From 6a10dfde9f8848aaa34e42b1288fc55382ff9ef6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jacob Moroni <jmoroni@google.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Apr 2026 14:53:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] irdma: Replace upstream irdma provider with OOT v2.9

Bulk replacement of the existing upstream irdma provider
with the OOT v2.9 provider.

Signed-off-by: Jacob Moroni <jmoroni@google.com>
---
